    "text": "Pages 70 and 71."
  },
  {
    "id": "2",
    "startMs": 4200,
    "endMs": 4680,
    "text": "Reading time"
  },
  {
    "id": "3",
    "startMs": 6260,
    "endMs": 7320,
    "text": "The wheel moves on"
  },
  {
    "id": "4",
    "startMs": 9660,
    "endMs": 12040,
    "text": "The wheel is an old invention."
  },
  {
    "id": "5",
    "startMs": 12900,
    "endMs": 15260,
    "text": "It is over 5,000 years old."
  },
  {
    "id": "6",
    "startMs": 17820,
    "endMs": 20380,
    "text": "Now we can find a lot of wheels around us."
  },
  {
    "id": "7",
    "startMs": 21380,
    "endMs": 25440,
    "text": "There are wheels at home, in the street and in the classroom."
  },
  {
    "id": "8",
    "startMs": 27360,
    "endMs": 33740,
    "text": "We can find wheels in a watch, a clock, an electric fan and a washing machine."
  },
  {
    "id": "9",
    "startMs": 35900,
    "endMs": 41240,
    "text": "We can find wheels on a bus, a bike, a train and a plane."
  },
  {
    "id": "10",
    "startMs": 43460,
    "endMs": 47280,
    "text": "Sometimes we can also find wheels on chairs or desks."
  },
  {
    "id": "11",
    "startMs": 51290,
    "endMs": 54840,
    "text": "The wheel is one of the most important inventions."
  },
  {
    "id": "12",
    "startMs": 56980,
    "endMs": 58950,
    "text": "Wheels make housework much easier."
  },
  {
    "id": "13",
    "startMs": 60950,
    "endMs": 63180,
    "text": "Wheels help people travel around easily."
  },
  {
    "id": "14",
    "startMs": 65150,
    "endMs": 67470,
    "text": "And wheels help people carry heavy things."
  },
  {
    "id": "15",
    "startMs": 69880,
    "endMs": 74860,
    "text": "Thanks to the wheel, we can save time and work to make more inventions."
  }
]
